WEBVTT

00:09:59.919 --> 00:10:04.106
and our little life
is rounded with a sleep.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:09.431
(Music)

00:10:09.455 --> 00:10:12.281
JT: Okay.

00:10:12.305 --> 00:10:16.255
(Applause)

00:10:16.279 --> 00:10:18.683
So I went from theater,
doing "The Tempest"

00:10:18.707 --> 00:10:21.007
on the stage in a very
low-budget production

00:10:21.031 --> 00:10:22.645
many years ago,

00:10:22.669 --> 00:10:25.090
and I love the play, and I also think

00:10:25.114 --> 00:10:27.114
it's Shakespeare's last play,

00:10:27.138 --> 00:10:30.794
and it really lends itself,
as you can see, to cinema.